# ── Okta Token Endpoint ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Used to get JWT tokens for each test user via Resource Owner Password flow
# or Client Credentials. Provide the token endpoint URL and client credentials.
#
# Option A: Resource Owner Password Grant (if enabled in Okta)
#   OKTA_TOKEN_URL=https://your-domain.okta.com/oauth2/your-auth-server/v1/token
#   OKTA_CLIENT_ID=your-client-id
#   OKTA_CLIENT_SECRET=your-client-secret (if confidential client)
#   OKTA_SCOPE=openid profile email groups
#
# Option B: Pre-generated tokens (simpler for dev)
#   Paste a valid JWT for each user role. Tokens expire — refresh as needed.
#
OKTA_TOKEN_URL=https://integrator-3023444.okta.com/oauth2/ausykohz3k9z4e9Wy697/v1/token
OKTA_CLIENT_ID=0oa10hizw04XI3CCt698
OKTA_CLIENT_SECRET=9RCQ5_iUJGeuKQdkNRLAIORFn9tlTfe3YZwGFiQasejzSInR_Mf9vmK7O5pqr_V2
